  "description": "OpenFeature-backed default for Elarion feature-flag gating: implements IFeatureFlagService over the OpenFeature IFeatureClient and maps Elarion's ICurrentUser into the OpenFeature EvaluationContext (targeting key + UserId/Groups), so [FeatureGate] works with any OpenFeature provider (LaunchDarkly, ConfigCat, flagd, Microsoft.FeatureManagement, ...). Opt-in via AddElarionOpenFeature; bring your own OpenFeature provider.",
